meta {
  name: BrickLink Inventory - Reconciliation
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

post {
  url: {{lego_data_ingress_base_url}}/internal/bricklink/inventory/reconciliation
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Runs the BrickLink inventory reconciliation now instead of waiting for the hourly job.

  Read-only: one BrickLink store read, no writes to BrickLink or the database. The result also updates the
  bricklink_inventory_reconciliation_* metrics, as a scheduled run would.

  Compares every ACTIVE local BrickLink listing with its lot and reports drift by type: MISSING_REMOTE_LOT,
  PRICE_DRIFT (skipped while a price change is in flight), QUANTITY_DRIFT, VISIBILITY_DRIFT, REMARKS_DRIFT
  and UNTRACKED_REMOTE_LOT. Outcome: IN_SYNC, DRIFT_FOUND or FAILED.

  Returns 404 when lego.bricklink.inventory-reconciliation.enabled is false in the target environment.
}
